	(text "SYSTEM HIERARCHY OVERVIEW (CO2037 PROJECT 1 - YOLO UNO REDESIGN)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 29.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.9 1.9)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "07e46221-4c9f-52b5-82a1-d479e0950013")
	)
	(text "Architecture Summary:\n- Sheet 2 (01_Power_Supply): 6-12V DC Reverse-Polarity MOSFET (AO3407A) + SMBJ15CA -> 5.05V/2A Sync Buck (TPS54202) + TPS2116 Power-Mux -> +5V & AP2114H-3.3 (1A) -> +3V3\n- Sheet 3 (02_MCU_ESP32S3): ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8 (16MB Flash, 8MB Octal PSRAM, 3.3V VDD_SPI), Decoupling (22uF+100nF), EN RC Delay (10k/1uF) & BOOT (GPIO0)\n- Sheet 4 (03_USB_and_LEDs): USB Type-C 16P (5.1k Rd x2) + USBLC6-2SC6 ESD, User LED D13 (GPIO48, 270 Ohm), WS2812B NeoPixel + SN74LV1T34 Level Shifter (GPIO45 + 10k PD)\n- Sheet 5 (04_Peripherals_and_Headers): Arduino UNO R3 Headers, 12x Grove (4 Analog, 4 Digital, 4 I2C), QWIIC, 1.5k I2C Pull-Ups, A0 0-5V Divider (JP1), 4x Servo GVS + 470uF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 63.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4e2f1f81-bced-57e7-bd6e-77bc77f9c5e9")
	)
	(text "MECHANICAL MOUNTING HOLES (UNO R3 M3 x4) & OPTICAL DFM FIDUCIALS (x3)"
